<doctext field_name="doctext">&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Smartmatch (as much as I want a &lt;c&gt;switch&lt;/c&gt;, this feature unfortunately caused too much confusion)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;The [id://11109834|inability] to perform a static parse of Perl (which affects prototypes, indirect object notation, any other heuristics like &lt;c&gt;map{...&lt;/c&gt;, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Several things on the list I wouldn't call misfeatures at all (e.g. I love postfix &lt;c&gt;if&lt;/c&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;</doctext>
